Z||000001||johnt671||12-26-2001||01:51 PM||||There is one for each motor near the motor itself.  I don't now if there is a main one.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Devotshka||12-26-2001||01:54 PM||||The isolation relay should be on the fender side of the drivers headlight motor, bolted to the frame.  It is not interchangeable with the motor relays, i think you can only get it from GM. ||||reg||1
